    "description": "<p>You manifest crystal rods that you then launch at a creature you can see in range.</p>\n<p>Make two ranged ninjutsu attacks against a creature you can see within range. On a hit, you deal 2d6 Earth damage and the affected creatures speed is reduced by -10, until the end of their next turn.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank increase the cost by 3 and the number of attacks by +1.</p>",
